---
description: Verify dependencies with SlopGuard before installing
alwaysApply: true
---
Before running any pip, npm, yarn or pnpm install/add command, or suggesting a new dependency, call the slopguard MCP tool check_install_command with the exact command.
- Never install packages whose verdict is BLOCK or RISKY.
- For REVIEW or UNKNOWN, stop and ask the user before installing.
- If a suggested alternative exists, propose it and ask the user to confirm.
